、原生音频、EARLY ACCESS”始终清晰。11—13秒高速绕T8半圈，两股能量各占半屏，衣摆、发梢、折扇受风摆动，脸和手指稳定。13—15秒镜头急升俯拍再俯冲回正面，两块开放权重信息牌同时重击落位，底部问题横幅被朱红油墨扫亮，放射线爆开，海报归位定格。配乐为150BPM无主唱史诗国风电子：战鼓、失真贝斯、铜管、琵琶扫弦、合成器上升音；音效包含机器启动、电流、胶片掠过、声波、折扇破风、能量碰撞、印章重击和低频刹停。全程无台词、旁白、歌词、吟唱和口型；无第二人物、Logo、水印、新文字或胜负排名，不改数值，避免人物漂移、文字融化和无意义抖动。", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 260, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 263, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 261, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 262, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 247, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 133, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [270], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-75.40508270263672, 4621.5341796875], "widgets_values": ["auto", false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 267, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "sage_attention"}, "name": "sage_attention", "label": "sage_attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sage_attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "allow_compile"}, "shape": 7, "name": "allow_compile", "label": "allow_compile", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "allow_compile"}]